---
// Strip at the bottom of a page listing <PointOfContact> children. A closing line sends everyone else
// to the contact and People pages.
---

<section class="border-t border-dusk py-10">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5">
    <h2 class="font-mono text-xs text-slate">Project points of contact</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 border-b border-dusk/60 text-alice">
      <slot />
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate">
      For anything else, use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or see who leads what on the <a href="/people">People page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
